          "da_id": "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.71",
          "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
          "text": "We have to make it fashionable . Like you uh said uh before .",
          "participant": "MTD023UID",
          "role": "UI"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.134",
          "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
          "text": "Yeah .",
          "participant": "MTD024ME",
          "role": "ME"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.84",
          "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
          "text": "Yeah .",
          "participant": "MTD021PM",
          "role": "PM"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.72",
          "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
          "text": "Uh yeah the basic functions .",
          "participant": "MTD023UID",
          "role": "UI"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.73",
          "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
          "text": "Um yeah only use a extra function if they are really needed .",
          "participant": "MTD023UID",
          "role": "UI"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.85",
          "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
          "text": "Yeah",
          "participant": "MTD021PM",
          "role": "PM"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.135",
          "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
          "text": "Yeah .",
          "participant": "MTD024ME",
          "role": "ME"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.86",
          "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
          "text": "so maybe you can hide them or something .",
          "participant": "MTD021PM",
          "role": "PM"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.74",
          "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
          "text": "Yeah .",
          "participant": "MTD023UID",
          "role": "UI"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.137",
          "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
          "text": "Yeah well what what we can do with the screen is is all the the configuration options , you can put that in the screen .",
          "participant": "MTD024ME",
          "role": "ME"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.87",
          "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
          "text": "Yeah you make a screen menu or something .",
          "participant": "MTD021PM",
          "role": "PM"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.138",
          "meeting_id": "TS3006b",
          "text": "And the and the <disfmarker>",
          "participant": "MTD024ME",
          "role": "ME"
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.83",
          "participant": "MTD021PM",
          "role": "PM",
          "text": "Okay ."
        },
        {
          "da_id": "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.139",
          "participant": "MTD024ME",
          "role": "ME",
          "text": "yeah screen menu to to to uh to do that ,"
        }
      ],
      "peer_items": [
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#0",
          "type": "actions",
          "text": "The UI Designer will design a menu for all functions."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#1",
          "type": "problems",
          "text": "The team has not clarified what the screen should do or what requirements it should satisfy."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#2",
          "type": "problems",
          "text": "The session shows language and clarity issues, with remarks like 'I have no idea' and 'not really English' hindering alignment."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#3",
          "type": "actions",
          "text": "The UI will design the basic function menu for the LCD screen."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#4",
          "type": "actions",
          "text": "The UI will list the functions to be included on the screen menu."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#5",
          "type": "problems",
          "text": "The layout as designed is bending and not working well; it is causing usability and stability issues in the prototype."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#6",
          "type": "actions",
          "text": "The Project Manager will write the meeting minutes."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#7",
          "type": "actions",
          "text": "The UI will create a nice multi-page menu for the LCD screen."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#8",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "The group proposed that the new product should reach new markets by targeting customers below forty."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#9",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "We will remove content for users under 16 and set the minimum age to sixteen, with advanced options available."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#10",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "Target age group for the remote is sixteen to forty (16–40 years)."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#11",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "We will limit control to a single device (one television) to simplify the system."
        }
      ],
